Description: NKE kubeadm node stack (Kubernetes {{K8S_VER}})
 Bundled Kubernetes stack with pkgs.k8s.io-style paths: /usr/bin/kubeadm,
 kubectl, kubelet; /usr/sbin/runc; kubelet systemd units under /lib/systemd/system;
 CNI and runtime components deployed by the bundled installer. Bundle metadata
 under /usr/lib/nke/{{MATRIX_SUBDIR}} with checksum sidecars. Postinst runs the Go
 installer from the packaged bundle tree, with no network fetch, and imports the
 bundled control-plane container images. Do not install alongside the upstream
 kubeadm, kubelet or CNI packages.
